    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solo dev creating a stealth-horror game where you\u2019re alone, unarmed, and being hunted. Every move must be careful. Explore a dark, hostile world and uncover a mystery hidden beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sneak. Survive. Discover the truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/14ae4e2b0052a2069ca79cd3e254b505.poster.avif?t=1752757133\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/14ae4e2b0052a2069ca79cd3e254b505.webm?t=1752757133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/14ae4e2b0052a2069ca79cd3e254b505.mp4?t=1752757133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fight for Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Sara, separated from her family in a brutal conflict. To reunite with them, she must navigate the ruins of a shattered world, using stealth and puzzle-solving to evade enemy drones and a terrifying secret weapon that hunts her every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/4861522fb4e3c5c8b8ee9b598b59811d.poster.avif?t=1752757133\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/4861522fb4e3c5c8b8ee9b598b59811d.webm?t=1752757133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/4861522fb4e3c5c8b8ee9b598b59811d.mp4?t=1752757133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/beeec9bc8714b2cb06acf71b5e96cd7b.poster.avif?t=1752757133\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/beeec9bc8714b2cb06acf71b5e96cd7b.webm?t=1752757133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/beeec9bc8714b2cb06acf71b5e96cd7b.mp4?t=1752757133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a third person exploration game where you traverse haunting landscapes, decaying cities, and uncovering clues about your loved ones. Strange balloons hint at a deeper mystery, drawing you into a gripping journey of hope and resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Haunting Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stirring, evocative score intensifies every moment, immersing you in a world forever changed by greed and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/82dfef3a2ffbcdd7666d7df05e1774e7.poster.avif?t=1752757133\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/82dfef3a2ffbcdd7666d7df05e1774e7.webm?t=1752757133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/82dfef3a2ffbcdd7666d7df05e1774e7.mp4?t=1752757133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solo dev creating a stealth-horror game where you\u2019re alone, unarmed, and being hunted. Every move must be careful. Explore a dark, hostile world and uncover a mystery hidden beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sneak. Survive. Discover the truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/14ae4e2b0052a2069ca79cd3e254b505.poster.avif?t=1752757133\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/14ae4e2b0052a2069ca79cd3e254b505.webm?t=1752757133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/14ae4e2b0052a2069ca79cd3e254b505.mp4?t=1752757133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fight for Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Sara, separated from her family in a brutal conflict. To reunite with them, she must navigate the ruins of a shattered world, using stealth and puzzle-solving to evade enemy drones and a terrifying secret weapon that hunts her every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/4861522fb4e3c5c8b8ee9b598b59811d.poster.avif?t=1752757133\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/4861522fb4e3c5c8b8ee9b598b59811d.webm?t=1752757133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/4861522fb4e3c5c8b8ee9b598b59811d.mp4?t=1752757133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/beeec9bc8714b2cb06acf71b5e96cd7b.poster.avif?t=1752757133\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/beeec9bc8714b2cb06acf71b5e96cd7b.webm?t=1752757133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/beeec9bc8714b2cb06acf71b5e96cd7b.mp4?t=1752757133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a third person exploration game where you traverse haunting landscapes, decaying cities, and uncovering clues about your loved ones. Strange balloons hint at a deeper mystery, drawing you into a gripping journey of hope and resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Haunting Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stirring, evocative score intensifies every moment, immersing you in a world forever changed by greed and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/82dfef3a2ffbcdd7666d7df05e1774e7.poster.avif?t=1752757133\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/82dfef3a2ffbcdd7666d7df05e1774e7.webm?t=1752757133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/82dfef3a2ffbcdd7666d7df05e1774e7.mp4?t=1752757133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
